Branch: `task-board/story/STORY-260830-2rqigd`\n- Base OID: `d805720ef2d0f862573018f2f5967a1b6c1dc628`\n- Candidate tree OID: `84843140f625a05e3fb1f4239f707cffe5d600c4`\n- Repository delta: `present`\n- Patch resource: `TASK-260830-3k3e6m_change-request_rev1.patch` (sha256 `b2c6b9d004675c99a81c3eca524e8e591c5a25b59ad4df1bbf1e6777976daadf`)\n\n```bash\ngit -C . diff d805720ef2d0f862573018f2f5967a1b6c1dc628 84843140f625a05e3fb1f4239f707cffe5d600c4          # the exact reviewable delta\ngit -C . diff --stat d805720ef2d0f862573018f2f5967a1b6c1dc628 84843140f625a05e3fb1f4239f707cffe5d600c4   # its shape\n```\n\nChanged paths (19):\n\n- `LOGBOOK.md`\n- `README.md`\n- `internal/matjournal/TRACEABILITY.md`\n- `internal/matjournal/crash_test.go`\n- `internal/matjournal/crash_unix_test.go`\n- `internal/matjournal/doc.go`\n- `internal/matjournal/journal.go`\n- `internal/matjournal/journal_test.go`\n- `internal/matjournal/marker.go`\n- `internal/matjournal/mutant_harness.py`\n- `internal/matjournal/recover.go`\n- `internal/matjournal/recover_test.go`\n- `internal/matjournal/refusal_test.go`\n- `internal/matjournal/store.go`\n- `internal/sessckpt/refusal_test.go`\n- `internal/traceability/cmd/tracecheck/main_test.go`\n- `internal/traceability/ownership.v0.6.0.json`\n- `internal/traceability/traceability.go`\n- `internal/traceability/traceability_test.go`\n\n### Recording the verdict\n\nAcceptance is a named mutation, not a status change:\n\n```bash\ntask-board m 'accept_cr(TASK-260830-3k3e6m, revision=1, evidence=TASK-260830-3k3e6m_review-verdict-rev1.md)'\n```\n\n`accept_cr` writes `accepted` and `integrating` atomically: the Change Request becomes `accepted`, this run is stamped as the reviewer, and TASK-260830-3k3e6m routes the element to `integrating` — accepted but not landed, and never `done`. The accepted revision is bound to its producer role and archetype (`developer`/`implementer`), and only a new tracked run with that exact producer role and archetype may checkpoint o