{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d649","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0ae11-990a-7e72-a802-0a0580c41ec6"},"sequence":2431,"recorded_at":1780531400004857,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"46e4ecbd-d202-41f9-9d18-3e98ef6b52fc","payload_type":"run.terminal.completed","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"run_terminal","command_id":"46e4ecbd-d202-41f9-9d18-3e98ef6b52fc","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"46e4ecbd-d202-41f9-9d18-3e98ef6b52fc"},"terminal":"completed","text":"Verdict: **ACCEPT** — CR-TASK-260830-3k3e6m-1 rev1 accepted, task routed to `integrating`. No P1/P2/P3 items.\n\nWhat I verified independently (all probes in an isolated copy; live worktree never mutated, still exactly the 19 candidate paths uncommitted):\n\n- **Spec conformance**: derived the 22-member journal shape, phase enum, token/bridge nullability tables, and coordinator order from the pinned §§10.6/13.12/13.13 myself and diffed against the code — every admitted phase edge is grounded, every forbidden edge (staging→committed, prepared→committed, terminal→anything) refuses.\n- **Recovery**: 9 crash tests name all CR-MAT-01..08 boundaries plus a real SIGKILL test; my 7 extra probes all pass, including exclusivity (provable commit + moved lease still parks), receipt-without-journal as absence, torn-journal quarantine byte-identical across reopen, and a 13.12 disk-full plant at a new boundary.\n- **Mutation**: producer's 11 narrowing mutants all reproduce KILLED (+control SURVIVED). I planted 4 more on unmutated arms — unfenced-continuation polarity, dormant open-token rule, 65536 bound off-by-one, digest-prefix compare — all KILLED, plus a control SURVIVED. The digest attack proved defense in depth: weakening one digest site still refuses; both must fall.\n- **Story-close**: forged-Admit negative is RED (dropping the same-epoch arm admits the forgery); ownership re-pinned with honest gap text (13.12 `unmeasured` declares its gap, matching registry precedent); tracecheck reproduces 105 cases / 59 bindings / 17-489; README sections carry test commands and no capability claims; last_error 1.2.0 justified by the catalog pin.\n- **Gates**: full `go test ./...` 28 packages ok, `-race` green, gofmt/vet/tracecheck clean.\n\nEvidence attached: `TASK-260830-3k3e6m_review-verdict-rev1.md` and `TASK-260830-3k3e6m_review-evidence-rev1.tar.gz` (verified gzip with probes, both harness logs, suite/race/gate logs).","reason":null}}
